    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Floor Area : 85 sqm (915 sqft)\nFlynn Estate Agents are thrilled to welcome number 38 Warren Avenue, Castleknock to the open market. This ideally located 3 bedroom family home is presented in excellent condition by its current owner also has additional scope to extend to rear should additional space be required. This home briefly consists of entrance hall, living room, kitchen and dining room with access to the super well maintained rear garden. Upstairs consists of two double bedrooms, a single bedroom and family bathroom complete the property. \n\nThe number 38 bus route offers an extremely practical and convenient lifestyle with being just 600 metres from Coolmine train station providing efficient access to Dublin City and beyond. The 37 bus route runs by the development as well as the property being less then a five minute walk to shops, cafes and schools. The villages of Castleknock and Blanchardstown, the M50 and the Phoenix Park are all a mere 5 minute drive.\n\nViewing is highly reccomended!!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall - 4.82m (15'10\") x 1.78m (5'10\")\nSemi-solid flooring.\n\nLiving room - 4.55m (14'11\") x 3.24m (10'8\")\nFeature solid fuel fireplace with tiled inset and timber surround. Semi-solid flooring. Doors to:\n\nKitchen/dining - 5.12m (16'10\") x 3.28m (10'9\")\nRange of fitted press units. Breakfast bar. Semi-solid flooring. PVC doors to rear.\n\nLanding - 3.28m (10'9\") x 1.98m (6'6\")\nHotpress. Carpet.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.89m (12'9\") x 3.16m (10'4\")\nBuilt-in wardrobes. Carpet.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.54m (11'7\") x 3.05m (10'0\")\nBuilt-in wardrobes. Carpet.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.83m (9'3\") x 2.27m (7'5\")\nBuilt-in wardrobes. Carpet.\n\nShower Room - 1.97m (6'6\") x 1.92m (6'4\")\nShower tray, whb and w.c. Under sink storage. Fully tiled floor & walls. Heated towel rail.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> PVC double glazed windows </li><li> Gas central heating </li><li> Chain free sale </li><li> Scope to extend </li><li> Prime location </li><li> Off street parking </li><li> Patio area</li></ul>"
      },
